{"id": "EUVD-2026-71310", "enisaUuid": "9968d676-b8b0-3eef-bab6-f08794ccde65", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nfuse: fix race between interrupt and resend\n\nAfter commit f8fce75fedf7 (\"fuse: clear intr_entry in fuse_resend and\nfuse_remove_pending_req\") the WARN_ON(!list_empty(&req->intr_entry)) in\nfuse_request_free() still triggers due to the following race:\n\nIn request_wait_answer()\n  if (test_bit(FR_SENT, &req->flags)) -> returns true\n\nIn fuse_chan_resend()\n  clear_bit(FR_SENT, &req->flags)\n\nIn request_wait_answer()\n  queue_interrupt(req)\n\nFix by:\n\n - move clearing FR_SENT inside fpq->lock\n\n - move setting FR_PENDING inside fiq->lock\n\n - recheck FR_SENT after acquiring fiq->lock in fuse_dev_queue_interrupt()", "datePublished": "2026-09-04T15:55:14", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:44:54", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/67ddf061790e833d7e34f9dc901866c9fb25d72d", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0f930904452945f409eeeb0c9afa08bf27185cb1", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/26fbe4bc3ef3ab0200407681cbef182af5d151de", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ed9c881f3b498383f73c42712b359419da42a7b0"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-80860", "GHSA-8279-rm4w-j7mp"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.16, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "00d6ec20-e3a4-3f8c-8c17-89e6366b3328", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7366e6f4d2b4c7002b13fb01219e83679dad4127 <0f930904452945f409eeeb0c9afa08bf27185cb1"}, {"id": "07523d8d-0b3f-341a-bf5e-daef9b1d9676", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "893479015cb6442fd389d3b553ab3036c9541715"}, {"id": "2317c04f-8dde-3d65-9859-04bc045f3ba7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.111"}, {"id": "35184c2e-823d-36ab-8de4-8e33f42905b6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7.1.4 <7.2"}, {"id": "37d89893-d7aa-3de7-bd9a-bc956e9cc582", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7.2"}, {"id": "4f1fba80-9f0b-3986-8fef-12463ef94ed4", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.12.96 <6.12.111"}, {"id": "62f2430b-6dc3-3240-9efe-492e3927bc3b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1d8ecd0cd696a5df0b2f72046a4ccee5d2a8ec2c <67ddf061790e833d7e34f9dc901866c9fb25d72d"}, {"id": "80303c87-bbb0-32c7-a66c-e6b8c2a2e96b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "f8fce75fedf73ac72aa09163deb8f4291fdcaad2 <26fbe4bc3ef3ab0200407681cbef182af5d151de"}, {"id": "8a0fc05a-c1f9-3ef5-a0cc-52958524e56d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.18.39 <6.18.51"}, {"id": "991870ed-f011-3e30-882c-77055a538c6c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.3"}, {"id": "9d40b29c-766a-3310-b0f7-67fa82a2355d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.51"}, {"id": "aeb2e325-556e-3d53-96da-2b530738e095", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "bc0f1fdd-13a3-3638-9e69-19e8e0951eae", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "f8fce75fedf73ac72aa09163deb8f4291fdcaad2 <ed9c881f3b498383f73c42712b359419da42a7b0"}, {"id": "d52c03ed-88bc-3aa0-be5c-133a32d37d53", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "9d29b866-5389-3c14-9618-b4da4bbf17ba", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}